  - line: 99
    type: narration
    text: "hidden interval: Oreck's route, settlement founding, family formation, and all household history before Geralt's arrival are unstaged."
  - line: 100
    type: narration
    text: "contradictions: Mika-wife/grave contamination; unexplained family history; unexplained Applicator reappearance; unresolved 249/250 history."
  - line: 101
    type: narration
    text: "chronological overlap: References to Mika, Karvex, the Five, and the 250 are retrospective rather than duplicate events."
  - line: 102
    type: narration
    text: "presentation: settlement arrival / family reunion / recruitment / farewell cutscene"
  - line: 103
